      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/charlotte_park_florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Charlotte Park sits on a low‑lying landscape of pine flatwoods, wetlands, and waterways that channel into Charlotte Harbor.",
